model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 §4 item 77 (#201), its next place (plan §9 item 2): a leg into a thing outside its lifespan on some days of a window. put's leg reaches box, which lives from 2026-03-08, so 03-05 to 03-07 refuse RUN-LIFESPAN and 03-08 to 03-10 book; pin and pout cross old, which lives to 2026-03-06, so 03-07 to 03-10 refuse. The plain lines must be HOLE-IMPRECISE (L §4.4 l.672 after R13.9)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind accts: place PLN signed
place jar: accts lives 2025-01-01..
place box: accts lives 2026-03-08..
place old: accts lives 2025-01-01..2026-03-06
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date
input wo: date

move put: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from jar to box amount amt

move pin: transfers
  on wo
  leg cash from jar to old amount amt

move pout: transfers
  on wo
  leg cash from old to world amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  wo = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  opening[jar] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[old] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask b_box: bal(box, 2026-03-31)
ask b_box_each_s1: bal(box, 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-05

ask b_box_each_s2: bal(box, 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-08
ask b_jar: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
ask b_jar_each_s1: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-05, wd = 2026-03-05

ask b_jar_each_s2: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-05, wd = 2026-03-07

ask b_jar_each_s3: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-05, wd = 2026-03-08

ask b_jar_each_s4: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-07, wd = 2026-03-07

ask b_jar_each_s5: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-08, wd = 2026-03-07

ask b_jar_each_s6: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) with wo = 2026-03-08, wd = 2026-03-08
ask b_old: bal(old, 2026-03-06)
ask b_old_each: bal(old, 2026-03-06)
ask f_put: flows(put, 2026-03)
ask f_put_each_s1: flows(put, 2026-03) with wd = 2026-03-05

ask f_put_each_s2: flows(put, 2026-03) with wd = 2026-03-08
